{"type":"data","nodes":[null,{"type":"data","data":[{"title":1,"excerpt":2,"tags":3,"film":13},"El hotel de los líos. García y García 2","Tras hacerse cargo de un hotelito destartalado, comprado por error en una subasta por un precio desorbitado, los dos Javier García viven una nueva aventura, ayudados esta vez, muy a su pesar, por un grupo de niños superdotados que se alojan en el hotel para asistir a la Final Nacional de Talentos. Junto a su explosiva profe, Martina, los niños se enfrentarán al mafioso Benito Camarena, que con sus secuaces - su madre y su hermano - tratarán de arrebatar a los García el botín escondido en el hotel, antigua guarida de los facinerosos. Spin-off de 'García y García' (2021).",[4,5,6,7,8,9,10,11,12],"education","homosociality","self-employment","holiday","intragenerational friendship","supernatural entity","intergenerational conflict","new start","rural",{"type":14,"id":15,"slug":16,"title":17,"release":19,"filmType":23,"directors":24,"genre":33,"media":36,"synopsis":39,"production":40,"characters":43,"roles":83,"awards":108,"tags":3},"Film","ES2023_007","es2023-007-el-hotel-de-los-lios-garcia-y-garcia-2",{"native":1,"english":18},"",{"type":20,"date":21,"year":22},"Theatrical release","2023-03-24",2023,"Fiction film",[25],{"id":26,"slug":27,"name":26,"birthYear":28,"deathYear":29,"gender":30,"nationality":31,"awards":32},"Ana Murugarren","ana-murugarren",1965,0,"Female identifying","Spain",[],[34,35],"Comedy","Children's Film",{"posterUrl":37,"trailerUrl":38},"https://www.imdb.com/title/tt21957640/mediaviewer/rm1999131393/?ref_=tt_ov_i","https://www.imdb.com/title/tt21957640/?ref_=nv_sr_srsg_0_tt_1_nm_0_in_0_q_El%2520hotel%2520de%2520los%2520l%25C3%25ADos.%2520Garc%25C3%25A",{"native":2,"english":18},[41],{"country":31,"share":42},"Majority coproducer",[44,58,65,75],{"id":45,"film":15,"person":46,"age":51,"gender":49,"sexuality":52,"origin":53,"class":54,"profession":55,"ability":56,"assistedMobility":57},"ES2023_007_01",{"id":47,"slug